            "review_title": "Review at Choi Go Jip Korean restaurant",
            "review_text": "Oren A\nLjubljana, Slovenia86 contributions\n0\nDecent but nothing special\nDec 2018 • Friends\nThe food was good but not spectacular. The quality of the meat was good. The side dishes were okay. The dipping sauce with the barbecue was nothing like the one you get in Korea. The girl who was barbecueing our meat overdid just about every piece. They should have left us do it ourselves. The bibimbab was plain and unexciting.\nThe prices are pretty high, especially for the drinks.\nWould not go back, but it was still a decent dinner.\nRead more\nWritten December 1, 2018",
