            "review_title": "Review at Choi Go Jip Korean restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jung112\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam118 contributions\n1\nUnfriendly environment\nApr 2018 • Friends\nThe Korean bbq here is decent although there are similar places all over Saigon. This has been around for a long time and moved around a few locations. They serve manly tourists and locals and you will see few Koreans here. The owner and waitstaff can use a lesson in customer service. The restaurant never felt welcoming and the staff are robotic. There’s not even a greeting from the Korean owner/ manager.\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2018",
