            "review_text": "Tom G\nHong Kong, China30 contributions\n0\nSuperb from start to finish.\nMar 2016 • Family\nCame here for my wife's birthday, was a last minute decision. I believe this is run by a Korean family and the 'son' was very attentive at the beginning and saw we needed some help as didnt have a reservation and with a young child, helped very quickly and smoothly, so a great start to the day. We were shown upstairs to a great spot, nice view of the street and also very private.\nWe ate far too much, but that's because it was all so good! Their meat is very tasty, would definitely recommend the marinated beef that they did, also the pork was super. Their staff were very attentive and all had big smiles which is helpful. Not speaking the language was not a problem, a staff member helped very eagerly. Definitely go all out and spend on the quality meat, it is worth it for sure. Overall, had a couple of bottles of Sake and lots to eat. \nHappy wife, happy life, so was a good end to the trip.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 21, 2016",
